{"ticker":"SNPS","updated":"2026-11-27T23:21:47Z","profile":{"longName":"Synopsys, Inc.","shortName":"Synopsys, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.synopsys.com","fullTimeEmployees":28000,"marketCap":80500801536,"trailingPE":74.217316,"forwardPE":22.455074,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.548941,"pegRatio":22.51,"targetMeanPrice":591.4865,"targetHighPrice":700.0,"targetLowPrice":475.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.424,"earningsGrowth":0.893,"grossMargins":0.82921,"operatingMargins":0.11031,"profitMargins":0.11432999,"totalRevenue":9416465408,"beta":1.184,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":539.48,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":362.55,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Synopsys, Inc. provides design IP solutions in the semiconductor and electronics industries. It operates in two segments, Design Automation and Design IP. The company offers Digital and Custom IC Design solution that provides digital design implementation solutions; Verification solution that offers virtual prototyping, static and formal verification, simulation, emulation, field programmable gate array (FPGA)-based prototyping, and debug solutions; FPGA design products that are programmed to perform specific functions; synopsys technology computer-aided design (TCAD), mask synthesis, and manufacturing analytic solutions; and AI-driven EDA solutions. It also provides pre-verified and silicon-proven IP solutions, logic libraries and embedded memories, processor and security solutions, IP Offerings for the automotive market, SOC infrastructure IP, data path and building block IP, and mathematical and floating-point components. Synopsys, Inc. has a strategic collaboration with Arm Holdings plc for development of AGI CPU that provides solutions across its full-stack design portfolio including EDA, interface IP, and hardware-assisted verification (HAV). It has a strategic partnership with OpenAI to revolutionize the design of semiconductors. Synopsys, Inc. has a strategic agreement with Amazon to accelerate Amazon's custom silicon innovation and advance the development of complex AI","summary_zh":"Synopsys, Inc. 為半導體和電子產業提供設計 IP 解決方案。它分為兩個部分：設計自動化和設計IP。該公司提供數位和客製化IC設計解決方案，提供數位設計實施方案；驗證解決方案，提供虛擬原型、靜態和形式驗證、模擬、模擬、基於現場可編程門陣列 (FPGA) 的原型和調試解決方案；FPGA設計產品被編程以執行特定功能； Synopsys 技術驅動輔助設計 (TCAD)、掩膜合成和分析解決方案；它還提供預先驗證和矽驗證的IP解決方案、邏輯庫和嵌入式記憶體、處理器和安全解決方案、汽車市場的IP產品、SOC基礎設施IP、資料路徑和構建塊IP以及數學和浮點組件。 Synopsys, Inc. 與 Arm Holdings plc 就 AGI CPU 的開發進行了策略合作，該 CPU 提供涵蓋 EDA、介面 IP 和硬體輔助驗證 (HAV) 等全端設計組合的解決方案。它與 OpenAI 建立了戰略合作夥伴關係，以徹底改變半導體的設計。 Synopsys, Inc. 與亞馬遜達成策略協議，以加速亞馬遜的客製化晶片創新並推動複雜人工智慧的發展","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":488.0,"h":491.96,"l":478.28,"c":481.61,"v":2905500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":482.05,"h":495.21,"l":480.79,"c":493.39,"v":2649400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":488.75,"h":495.72,"l":484.5,"c":488.78,"v":2017600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":484.7,"h":489.29,"l":470.35,"c":471.15,"v":2693400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":473.5,"h":475.8,"l":466.59,"c":469.17,"v":2263600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":471.99,"h":481.23,"l":469.55,"c":478.22,"v":1651000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":484.11,"h":484.11,"l":468.43,"c":477.83,"v":1222200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":476.81,"h":492.36,"l":476.72,"c":489.36,"v":1789600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":487.5,"h":488.08,"l":480.69,"c":484.41,"v":1727500},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":484.41,"h":487.58,"l":437.27,"c":438.92,"v":3588200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":449.48,"h":453.8,"l":440.0,"c":448.0,"v":2260600},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":436.41,"h":452.8,"l":433.36,"c":443.76,"v":2937600},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":446.26,"h":448.89,"l":432.0,"c":435.9,"v":3109700},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":439.53,"h":445.54,"l":435.58,"c":440.2,"v":1931300},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":435.64,"h":456.84,"l":435.26,"c":447.64,"v":2510400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":450.66,"h":457.82,"l":449.0,"c":453.35,"v":1539900},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":448.25,"h":459.69